      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm totally against the sudden release of guided mode.\n\nHere is my thoughts.\n\nYou are introducing a system that only newbies can see so that no one would know if there's a bug, not to mention reporting it. For now I've seen newbies entering without this mode showing up. It brings major confusion for Japanese VRChat guide communities.\n\nPlease consider implementing guided mode only after you carry out localizations, and enable it only for English locales. (Also be aware of the user OS locales since not all languages are included in your localizations)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
