  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There is a problem with the guided mode design itself.\n\nCurrently guidedmode is send newbie to RANDOM world.\n\nYou would know that some JP world is shut out non Japanese speaker to eliminate malicious weeb.\n\nIf newbie is send to such world, she/he will get confusing and feel bad.\n\nAnd also, the problem is even more serious for non-English speakers. I don't think I need an explanation, how can they meet someone who speaks the same language?\n\nPlease postpone add guided mode. This feature need more preparation such as make a world list for each mother tongue.",
